{"id":"f93b4f900475f7b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-huge-hierarchy.md","title":"Huge Cardinals Are Supercompact","display":"thm-huge-hierarchy — Huge Cardinals Are Supercompact","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-huge-hierarchy","aliases":["58-thm-huge-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-huge-hierarchy — Huge Cardinals Are Supercompact","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-huge-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-huge-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-huge-hierarchy — Huge Cardinals Are Supercompact"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-huge.md\">../batch18/58-df-huge.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a78f267f6eefd08\" href=\"?note=6a78f267f6eefd08\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md\">../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Huge}\">\\(\\mathrm{Huge}\\)</span> (huge-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-huge.md\">../batch18/58-df-huge.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\)</span> (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a78f267f6eefd08\" href=\"?note=6a78f267f6eefd08\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md\">../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The closure length in a huge-cardinal witness is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\)</span>, not a free ordinal parameter.</li>\n<li>In the usual large-cardinal hierarchy, every huge cardinal is supercompact.</li>\n<li>The cited huge-cardinal atom already binds the class witness and its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\)</span>-sequence closure. Repeating that witness here would require class quantifiers and must not use the set-coded predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-huge.md","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-huge.md","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$ (huge-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S$ (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Huge}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"j(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"j(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-huge-hierarchy.md|58-thm-huge-hierarchy]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["641a3566187bf66b","6a78f267f6eefd08"]}